Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash? Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, Rem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I become?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might not have made it otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think nothing of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need anything else, all you have\Nto do is ask. I will. Thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, already that's an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you some soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a small village, about 200\Nmiles from the town of Valar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of very kind\Npeople living in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They let us stay at this house\Nso we could care for your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.48,0:03:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been asleep since we\Narrived, for ten days straight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.56,0:03:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my own recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good for healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back later, kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you drink all your soup, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Meryl? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is your friend doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he feeling any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, much better, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He finally regained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, if he keeps healing at this\Nrate, he should be up and about real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:04:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Meryl, that's wonderful news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, oh, yeah, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's today's wages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making you do all the work\Nby yourself, it's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always work the fields\Nat home, and besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by keeping busy, I don't have\Ntime to think about my problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I don't think\Nabout anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incidentally, how is the\Nwell coming along anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the schedule,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like we should reach the\Nunderground water vein in about one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's splurge on dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, do you really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know something, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place kind of\Nreminds me of my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your home is actually like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a quiet, plain,\Nordinary little village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was a great place to live,\Nbecause my whole family was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Knives is right out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one I've been searching\Nfor is so close, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then just answer me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell do you intend to do\Nonce you've actually found Knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, he stole someone\Nwho was very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.80,0:06:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you choose to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolf, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do when I see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually killed a man with my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could I possibly say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ram. Ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a sinner too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wounds haven't had\Na chance to heal yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vash, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go. Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you planning\Nto go in that condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go see Rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go to where Rim is. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you have to snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let us help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me now. I could never go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back I really killed someone I shot him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dead I Did I took his life but Vash\Nyou didn't have a choice I'm ending
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives there's Always another choice\Nthere had to be another way I just didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see it in time To do anything about\Nit Rem said so there had to be a way
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ram, please tell me, did I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Vash, you can't! Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Millie, maybe following\Nhim wasn't such a good idea after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't followed him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't have had\Nto make such a terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,choice and things might\Nhave turned out differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, he wouldn't have gotten hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have had to suffer like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason you followed Vash is because\Nyou care about him, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have happened anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with taking a stand\Nand acting with your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like my big, big sister always said,\Nnever hold back in matters of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should be the one\Nthat makes the decisions now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, nothing. Never\Nmind. Forget what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to keep going, so prepare\Nto work your butt off tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Vash, you take care of\Nthe house while we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we've been taking care of him, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash looks a little happier\Nnow, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, you're awfully late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can only say that because you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys probably aren't aware of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a whole lot of weird shit has\Nbeen going on around here lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mass disappearances in 12\Ntowns with no trace of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,L .R.'s one big war zone\Nand my family's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about the only peaceful town left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First time I've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two girls just showed up in town with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was about ten days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor fellow was in horrible shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shot full of bullet holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing he survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have I seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with the shouting, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get in the damn truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hurry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we leaving in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must crash the stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one guy sitting there was\Ndefinitely the humanoid typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooooooooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooooooooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the first evening a pebble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From somewhere out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drops upon the dreaming world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the second celestial\Nevening All the children
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the pebble join hands\Nand Compose our waltz?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a nice song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can... Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stay here as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might not be such a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get very much sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:13:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really had us fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even bother playing dumb. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you bring someone like Vash\Nthe Stampede here to endanger our home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We mean you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that we don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we ask is that you leave\Nhere and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't agree to\Ndo that, you might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now tell him what'll\Nhappen to your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.54,0:14:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you feel some of\Nthe pain of the people
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who died because of\Nyour reckless behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something at least\Nmake some kind of excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible this guy\Nisn't him? Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that guy\Nto be such a wuss. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am. Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Vash the Stampede. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing but a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get to fighting with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough of your crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for everyone you've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now smile
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:16:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you could have the decency to\Ndie like a man, so come on you shit smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Said smile damn it stop it please
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand he fought to\Nprotect everyone I beg you please
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't kill him He just came here to\Nheal he wasn't going to hurt anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could a normal human being\Ndo all those horrible things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to be the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who else could have been responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did Steven have to\Ndie such a horrible death, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've watched him for a\Nlong time, so I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that he can't avoid fighting,\Nbut this man knows how to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To live like a decent human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting him won't help anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't feed me your garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the right to shoot\Nthis monster for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lost friends families
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neighbors and even children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hate this bastard,\Nand now he deserves to die
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're wrong no one ever has the\Nright to take the life of another person
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one, no one ever has the right\Nto take the life of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one, and everyone,\Neveryone deserves a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stay back! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, it's time to\Nstop the fighting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to us to end the cycle of hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't work to end\Nthe sorrow this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the cycle of pain\Nwill just continue on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were all born,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were any of us made to\Nsteal or cause others harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:18:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People have many different\Nways of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if a mistake is made,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as a person realizes their mistake,\Nit's possible to make it right again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you keep your vision\Nclear, you will see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what one must realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask, but how long\Nare you planning to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is a great day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go, baby! You forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm injured, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The red flower Rem loved, the geranium,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the language of flowers\Nmeans determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be okay see you later good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks and thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:21:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you to take this with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you I know it would make mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wolf would happy in\Nfact it would Honor him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is pretty heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because it's full of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.26,0:21:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, take care of yourselves. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say anything to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can tell him\Neverything when he gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:22:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go nuts on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the last thing\Nshe tried to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never go wrong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans are survivors, so\NI will take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.28,0:23:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.82,0:24:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, that time, 130 years\Nago, we were born, weren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.24,0:24:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was nothing but peaceful days,\Nand Rem was always close behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our disagreeing thoughts changed\Neach of our ways of life, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.90,0:24:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.46,0:24:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will vow once again not to kill,\Nnot to betray, but to find happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to talk about my dreams, because the\Nticket to the future is always blank.

